---
import StaticPage from '@/layouts/StaticPage.astro';
import { SITE } from '@/config/site';
import { TOOL_LIST } from '@/config/tools';
---

<StaticPage
  eyebrow="Company"
  h1="About MyJSONPal"
  lead="A privacy-first, in-browser JSON & data studio built for developers who value speed and privacy."
  metaTitle="About MyJSONPal | Privacy-First JSON Tools"
  metaDescription="Learn about MyJSONPal — a free, privacy-first, in-browser JSON formatter, validator, and converter suite. No uploads, no servers, no accounts."
  keywords={['about myjsonpal', 'json formatter', 'privacy first json tool', 'json studio', 'free json tools']}
  path="/about"
  updated="August 1, 2026"
>
  <h2 id="mission">Our mission</h2>
  <p>
    JSON is everywhere — API responses, config files, build pipelines, data exports. Yet most
    online tools for working with it upload your data to a remote server you don't control.
    MyJSONPal exists to give developers a fast, capable JSON studio that respects one
    non-negotiable rule: <strong>your data stays on your machine</strong>.
  </p>

  <h2 id="why-we-built-it">Why we built it</h2>
  <p>
    Working with JSON usually means juggling half a dozen tabs and pasting sensitive payloads
    into third-party websites. We wanted a single place that could format, validate,
    auto-repair, minify, and convert JSON — with a clean interface, instant results, and
    complete privacy. Everything here runs in your browser through a Web Worker, so even
    multi-megabyte documents are processed quickly without freezing the page.
  </p>

  <h2 id="what-we-offer">What MyJSONPal offers</h2>
  <ul>
    {
      TOOL_LIST.map((tool) => (
        <li>
          <a href={tool.path}>{tool.h1}</a>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ul>

  <h2 id="privacy">Privacy by design</h2>
  <p>
    Privacy isn't a feature we bolt on — it's the foundation of the product. There are no
    accounts, no sign-ups, no usage quotas, and no telemetry that sees your content. Paste,
    work, close the tab, and it's gone.
  </p>

  <h2 id="free-forever">Free forever</h2>
  <p>
    All tools on MyJSONPal are free to use without limits or registration. The project is
    maintained by a small independent developer who believes developer utilities should be
    open, fast, and private by default.
  </p>

  <h2 id="get-in-touch">Get in touch</h2>
  <p>
    Feedback, feature requests, or bug reports? We'd love to hear from you via our{' '}
    <a href="/contact">contact page</a>, or{' '}
    <a href={SITE.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      follow development on GitHub
    </a>
    .
  </p>
</StaticPage>
